System Workflow
Load educational PDF documents.
Extract and preprocess text.
Divide documents into smaller overlapping chunks.
Generate semantic embeddings using Sentence Transformers.
Store embeddings in the FAISS vector index.
Retrieve relevant content based on student queries.
Generate answers using the FLAN-T5 Large model.
Track student performance and adapt learning difficulty.

